# The root tsconfig extends `.nuxt/tsconfig.json`, which is generated and not
# part of the image. Since Nuxt 4.5 the docs build picks that config up from the
# workspace root and then fails on the missing file - the docs project has its
# own tsconfig and needs none of it.
